 "words_heard": 261,
 "words": 272,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "A sower went out to sow his seed in the morning sun",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.49,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He scattered it with open hands and didn't miss a one",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.31,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Some fell along the hard-packed path where people come and go",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.15,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The birds came down and ate it up before it had a chance to grow",
   "heard": 15,
   "words": 15,
   "error_s": 0.36,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Listen, listen, whoever has ears",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.42,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Let him hear the word that the sower brings",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.64,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Some fell here and some fell there",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.23,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But the good soil bears a hundredfold",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.76,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Some fell on the rocky ground with little soil to keep",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.66,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "It sprang up quick and green and proud, but the roots were never deep",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 0.72,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "When the sun rose it was scorched and withered in the heat",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.7,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Like a heart that takes the word with joy but falls when trouble meets",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 0.74,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Some fell in among the thorns that grew up thick and tall",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.69,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The worries of this life came in and choked it, leaf and all",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.7,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And the deceitfulness of wealth wound round it like a chain",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.74,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "It grew but never bore a fruit, it never filled with grain",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.65,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Listen, listen, whoever has ears",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.14,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Let him hear the word that the sower brings",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Some fell here and some fell there",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.26,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But the good soil bears a hundredfold",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.76,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But other seed fell on good soil, in the soft and open ground",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.73,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "It heard the word and understood, and the roots went deep and down",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.75,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "It bore a crop of thirtyfold and sixty in the field",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.68,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And a hundredfold of harvest from the little seed it held",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.7,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Some fell here and some fell there",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.2,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But the good soil bears a hundredfold",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.73,
   "tie_split": false,
